* START-HISTORY:
* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 8c2dfc4 (12 Oct 26): 1.2-0 bundle B-8 (openQM ref 53): opening = 2, before the file of a mode 3 print unit is made, takes an
*               update lock on its record in $HOLD and keeps it until the file is closed (opening = 0).
* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 37b0630 (12 Oct 26): 1.2-0 bundle A-6 (openQM ref 56).
* END-HISTORY
